  "reasoning": "The appellant committed three separate thefts of electric cables from construction sites, each meeting the elements of theft (盗窃罪) with a total value over 20,000 RMB. Additionally, after his vehicle was lawfully seized by the court, he unlawfully removed and drove away the seized vehicle, which constitutes the crime of illegally handling property that has been lawfully detained (非法占有被扣押财产罪). No other distinct crimes are evident from the facts.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]盗窃;非法占有被扣押财产<eoa>"
}
